# type(scope): what changed
#
# Why, in at most 5 lines. What was wrong, and why this is the fix.
# Not how it was found, what was tried first, or what you thought about it.
# Omit the body entirely when the subject already says it.
#
# types:  feat fix refactor perf docs test build chore revert
# scopes: stm32 esp32 libs tools scripts config docs site build  (optional)
#
# Subject <= 72 chars, lower-case, no trailing period.
# Enforced by scripts/lint/check_commit_msg.py via the commit-msg hook.
